<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Jacor started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Jacor started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said on Monday analyst Frank Bodenchek had started coverage of Jacor Communications Inc with a rating of strong buy.</p>
<p>-- Shares in the Cincinnati media company closed on Thursday at 28.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk (212) 859-1730))</p>
</text>
